<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian</p>
<p>soccer matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p>Sao Paulo championship</p>
<p> Botafogo-Ribeirao Preto  1   America/S.J. do Rio Preto 1</p>
<p> Corinthians		  2   Sao Paulo		     2</p>
<p> Palmeiras		    5   Juventus			1</p>
<p> Portuguesa Santista	0   Internacional Limeira     2</p>
<p> Rio Branco		   1   Aracatuba		     0</p>
<p> Santos			 2   Portuguesa		    1</p>
<p> Sao Jose		     3   Guarani			 4</p>
<p> Uniao Sao Joao	     1   Mogi Mirim		    1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>	  Group one</p>
<p> Palmeiras		 4  3  1  0 16  3 10</p>
<p> Guarani		   4  3  1  0 12  7 10</p>
<p> Santos		    4  3  0  1  8  5  9</p>
<p> Portuguesa		4  1  1  2  9  8  4</p>
<p> Sao Jose		  4  1  1  2  7 12  4</p>
