<p> America		   4  0  2  2  3 11  2</p>
<p> Juventus		  4  0  1  3  3 11  1</p>
<p>Group two</p>
<p> Sao Paulo		 4  3  1  0 12  4 10</p>
<p> Corinthians	     4  2  2  0  7  4  8</p>
<p> Internacional Limeira 4  2  1  1  6  5  7</p>
<p> Portuguesa Santista   4  2  0  2  5  7  6</p>
<p> Mogi Mirim		4  1  2  1  5  5  5</p>
<p> Uniao Sao Joao	  4  1  1  2  3  5  4</p>
<p> Rio Branco		4  1  0  3  4  9  3</p>
<p> Aracatuba		 4  0  1  3  3  6  1</p>
<p>Note: the teams play once against the teams from their own</p>
<p>group and then twice against the teams in the opposite group.</p>
<p>The top two teams in each group then qualify for the four-team</p>
<p>final stage.</p>
<p>Rio de Janeiro championship, first stage</p>
<p> America-Rio de Janeiro   0   Flamengo			0</p>
